        <div  class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap">
            <div class="w-full md:w-6/12 md:pr-8">
                <dl class="mt-6 space-y-3 divide-y divide-gray-200">
                    <div class="pt-3">
                        <dt class="text-lg">
                            <!-- Expand/collapse question button -->
                            <button onclick="toggleFaq('faq-1')" class="text-left w-full flex justify-between items-start text-gray-400">
                                <span class="font-medium text-gray-900">
                                    Can I also pay annually?
                                </span>
                                <span class="ml-6 h-7 flex items-center">
                                    <svg data-toggle="faq-1" class="rotate-0 h-6 w-6 transform" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
                                    </svg>
                                </span>
                            </button>
                        </dt>
                        <dd class="mt-2 pr-12">
                            <p data-toggle="faq-1" class="text-base text-gray-700 hidden">
                                Yes. We also offer you a 20% discount if you choose an annual subscription plan.
                            </p>
                        </dd>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pt-3">
                        <dt class="text-lg">
                            <!-- Expand/collapse question button -->
                            <button onclick="toggleFaq('faq-2')" class="text-left w-full flex justify-between items-start text-gray-400">
                                <span class="font-medium text-gray-900">
                                    Will request errors be counted towards my monthly limit?
                                </span>
                                <span class="ml-6 h-7 flex items-center">
                                    <svg data-toggle="faq-2" class="rotate-0 h-6 w-6 transform" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
                                    </svg>
                                </span>
                            </button>
                        </dt>
                        <dd class="mt-2 pr-12">
                            <p data-toggle="faq-2" class="text-base text-gray-700 hidden">
                                No, we only charge you for successful responses. Invalid requests are not going to affect your usage volume!
                            </p>
                        </dd>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pt-3">
                        <dt class="text-lg">
                            <button onclick="toggleFaq('faq-3')" class="text-left w-full flex justify-between items-start text-gray-400">
                                <span class="font-medium text-gray-900">
                                    How much load can your API take?
                                </span>
                                <span class="ml-6 h-7 flex items-center">
                                    <svg data-toggle="faq-3" class="rotate-0 h-6 w-6 transform" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
                                    </svg>
                                </span>
                            </button>
                        </dt>
                        <dd class="mt-2 pr-12">
                            <p data-toggle="faq-3" class="text-base text-gray-700 hidden">
                                Our API handles millions of API requests on a daily basis. For our standard plans, we encourage not to exceed 400 concurrent connections. If you need more, please let us know and we are happy to increase that limit for you.
                                Also, we offer an asynchronous batch endpoint, which is useful for extremely large data sets.
                            </p>
                        </dd>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pt-3">
                        <dt class="text-lg">
                            <!-- Expand/collapse question button -->
                            <button onclick="toggleFaq('faq-4')" class="text-left w-full flex justify-between items-start text-gray-400">
                                <span class="font-medium text-gray-900">
                                    Which payment methods do you support?
                                </span>
                                <span class="ml-6 h-7 flex items-center">
                                    <svg data-toggle="faq-4" class="rotate-0 h-6 w-6 transform" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
                                    </svg>
                                </span>
                            </button>
                        </dt>
                        <dd class="mt-2 pr-12">
                            <p data-toggle="faq-4" class="text-base text-gray-700 hidden">
                                We accept all common payment methods, including credit cards (MasterCard, Visa, American Express). Enterprise and high-volume customers may request annual bank transfer payments to be enabled.
                            </p>
                        </dd>
                    </div>


                </dl>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full md:w-6/12 md:pl-8">
