                                    What is the API's uptime?
                                </span>
                                <span class="ml-6 h-7 flex items-center">
                                    <svg data-toggle="faq-7" class="rotate-0 h-6 w-6 transform" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
                                    </svg>
                                </span>
                            </button>
                        </dt>
                        <dd class="mt-2 pr-12">
                            <p data-toggle="faq-7" class="text-base text-gray-700 hidden">
                                We are constantly tracking and monitoring the uptime of our service. We are doing every effort to ensure a maximum of availability and reliability, leading to an uptime of 99.9%, calculated on the past 12 months.
